WEBVTT

00:08:27.002 --> 00:08:30.339
Because they don't employ means testing,
there's less stigma attached,

00:08:30.381 --> 00:08:33.634
so the people accessing resources
actually use them,

00:08:33.634 --> 00:08:35.761
as opposed to what we get
with means testing,

00:08:35.803 --> 00:08:38.055
where you feel like you shouldn't
be doing that.

00:08:38.097 --> 00:08:41.016
And importantly,

00:08:41.058 --> 00:08:44.395
they have the buy-in
of that political class

00:08:44.436 --> 00:08:46.188
that is all-important in democracy,

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:47.565
the middle class.

00:08:48.107 --> 00:08:51.819
There's a reason why the NHS in Britain

00:08:51.819 --> 00:08:55.114
is still around after 80 years,
and it's so loved.

00:08:55.155 --> 00:08:57.074
It's because everybody gets to use it.

00:08:57.074 --> 00:08:58.826
It's part of the national fabric.

00:08:58.826 --> 00:09:01.745
It’s part of our shared
social conversation and space.